      "engineering_question": "怎样让面板按钮与取消操作正确消费 control，同时保留子控件、文字输入和玩法输入各自的路径？",
      "knowledge_status": "research",
      "retrieval_status": "restricted",
      "coding_status": "hold",
      "scope": {
        "source_epoch": "DST scripts 762172 / Steam build 26474873",
